{"id": "1704825", "name": "מערכת משוואות 3X3 שיש לה אינסוף פתרונות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "random_invertible_matrix", "params": ["n"], "body": "genmatrix (LowerWithDiag1, n, n).transpose(genmatrix (LowerWithDiag1, n, n))"}, {"name": "makeSolCol", "params": ["m", "rk"], "body": "(v:zeromatrix(m,1), for i thru rk do(v[i][1]:rand_with_prohib(-3,3,[])),v)"}, {"name": "random_rrechelon_mmatrix", "params": ["m", "n", "min_val", "max_val", "pivots_cols"], "body": "block([row, A, pivots],\n    row:1,\n    pivots: sort(pivots_cols),\n    A:zeromatrix(m,n),\n    for i thru length(pivots) do(\n        piv: pivots[i],\n        A[row][piv]:1,\n        for j:piv+1 thru n do (\n            A[row][j]:rand_with_prohib(min_val,max_val,[])\n            ),\n        row:row+1\n        ),\n     for i thru length(pivots) do(\n        piv: pivots[i],\n        for j:1 thru i-1 do (\n            A[j][piv]:0\n            )\n        ),\n    A)"}, {"name": "eq", "params": ["i"], "body": "(lhs:sum (cofMatrix[i,j]*vars[j],j,1,n),rhs:solVect[i,1],lhs=rhs)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונה מערכת המשוואות הבאה במשתנים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( x_1,x_2,x_3 \\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">{{CT:0}}</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">{{CT:1}}</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">{{CT:2}}</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מה הצורה המדורגת קנונית של מטריצת המקדמים המורחבת המייצגת מערכת זו?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>מה דרגת המטריצה המייצגת את מערכת המשוואות?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><p>האם למערכת יש פתרון?</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div><div s